{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 39","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_39\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 39</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Mass_Geometry)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Mass Geometry)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Menelaus’s_Theorem)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Menelaus’s Theorem)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Ceva_and_Menelaus)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Ceva and Menelaus)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_39\">Problem 39</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 39\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c970cbf5e2e7029089517d5e8efbb8cade6d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> are drawn so that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/5/5f57554168ff42d5806b7ba997f07b5c65a92ca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{CD}{DB}=\\dfrac{3}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71b896e1b1acbc03df27521689afafa9876fefd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{AE}{EB}=\\dfrac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/a/1aa54acf4f45c51ba1569e32101b85596f092880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=\\dfrac{CP}{PE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" /> \nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the intersection point of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c970cbf5e2e7029089517d5e8efbb8cade6d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/0/a60944d306f088a476d6be2e167d8b32911f1fa1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(8cm); pair A = (0, 0), B = (9, 0), C = (3, 6); pair D = (7.5, 1.5), E = (6.5, 0); pair P = intersectionpoints(A--D, C--E)[0]; draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(A--D); draw(C--E); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, N); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, NE); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, S); label(&quot;$P$&quot;, P, S); //Credit to MSTang for the asymptote[/asy]\" width=\"378\" height=\"268\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/3787df60d88b6809e8afc3ac45d5e3839fd235be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{3}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"355\" height=\"37\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/3/9e3be8cc3f1e2f845abbc4c8d19863aefc6e5281.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(8cm); pair A = (0, 0), B = (9, 0), C = (3, 6); pair D = (7.5, 1.5), E = (6.5, 0); pair P = intersectionpoints(A--D, C--E)[0]; draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(A--D); draw(C--E); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, N); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, NE); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, S); label(&quot;$P$&quot;, P, S); draw(P--B,dotted); //Credit to MSTang for the asymptote[/asy]\" width=\"378\" height=\"268\" />\n</p><p>Draw line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/9/9f988caff51f7fc88ad40d1d25022c52ffd8f976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PB$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/5/35550d54864923b1aa5472177f6c82ddf9e1438a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[PEB] = 2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9cab3627aac1050999f9fd7c755aeb9327ca93de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[PDB] = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/0/5c09fc8b2bec31526774952b44ec526668341f0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[CAP] = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca321afc6b940bcdc02a66e897aecc654ffaf9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[CPD] = 3a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd9039f6e34ac7f98df7013193d30ef1a46afdd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[APE] = 3b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />.  Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37c8f83cb958c66bd093ce4ecaaeb511cde6c3c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CAE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd0941332df51be1f43d6d79c408718ff41b234e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CEB$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> share an altitude,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/d/24d5e1062b8845e53a6e3699a63fe638d73ed9e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c + 3b = \\tfrac{3}{2} (3a+a+2b)\\]\" width=\"184\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/8352c5ea534016b8d97cb06244020cdef3e6f6d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c + 3b = 6a + 3b\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/9/c196d5dd6d5fa435109e481a6ce21f0b5ee82a08.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c  = 6a\\]\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />\nBecause <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/7/0f7a55113a84ee4c04eb66f66d08310c32533ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ACD$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/5/f75d6d58b03031bd7cb52a7ca886a8ddf369d21c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> share an altitude,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/1/6a1bb1cb5da1932df869f9670f539cc217ff319e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6a+3a = 3(a+2b+3b)\\]\" width=\"193\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/b/6db732108d5c78b9af6fe5392d391be92d7c8bb7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9a = 3a+15b\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/7/5d7e1cfe0b8888fe8a865257f7983f467b3cb399.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6a = 15b\\]\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/2/572d0cc17d3a1d6170fb36139414721f130cf4a2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = \\tfrac{5}{2}b\\]\" width=\"52\" height=\"21\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/7/6d777d5b027cfeeb0622aea2fbf67d70930bf1cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[CAP] = 15b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd9039f6e34ac7f98df7013193d30ef1a46afdd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[APE] = 3b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/91537591c3cf44453aece0675ddccf2e56439511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\tfrac{CP}{PE} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"90\" height=\"21\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Mass_Geometry.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Mass_Geometry)\">Solution 2 (Mass Geometry)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Mass Geometry)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the mass of point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/4/a04936a1062defb60094e4ac3f7ff717df796d1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed42655478b1f62be2060ff04a7a6b64859b62ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/0169ecca1207d6d620f7269a6077a044f09de007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/c/52c3e00309e8eaf0b355e378c618ab324a59e074.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/8/89875fc7f87caa5b35e0e83b3a0b030b60c00c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> respectively.\nBy mass geometry theorems, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/1/f01754e3697489ad91af4da26b8a750e9ca1a60c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{CP}{PE} = \\frac{mE}{mC} \\end{align*}\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" />\nFocusing on the line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, using mass geometry theorems, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/9/fe98622a3a6b2394eb25b18d6ad0c84bce602858.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} mE = mA + mB \\end{align*}\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/5/7855a699ed6c26490a3414a9f1fa667025f99d93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{3}{2} &amp;= \\frac{mB}{mA} \\\\ mA &amp;= \\frac{2}{3}mB \\end{align*}\" width=\"96\" height=\"80\" />\nwhich leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d165c83ae78431dbaec7e26a35e68d59c7800f50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mE = \\frac{5}{3}mB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"38\" />.\nFor line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e3a4ec0df571e719bd3f1d7e00bf71fc55ba2b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CB$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />, similarly, we got\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/d/18da13ad830b8f259504a5e3e025511e032353a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[mC = \\frac{1}{3}mB\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"37\" />\nSubstituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/0169ecca1207d6d620f7269a6077a044f09de007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/8/89875fc7f87caa5b35e0e83b3a0b030b60c00c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> back to the equation we obtained at the beginning, we got:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/a/e8a6cd989b1bfb7f8d653b3e8fa7f4d153c43fea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{CP}{PE} = \\frac{mE}{mC} = \\frac{\\frac{5}{3}mB}{\\frac{1}{3}mB} = 5 \\end{align*}\" width=\"191\" height=\"47\" />\nwhich gives us the answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />. -nullptr07\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Menelaus.E2.80.99s_Theorem.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Menelaus’s_Theorem)\">Solution 3 (Menelaus’s Theorem)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Menelaus’s Theorem)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By using Menelaus’s Theorem on triangle BCE and points A, P, D, we can substitute in the known values to find that the answer is 5:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/09328040164d6ce474e238758129d89ad36eb26f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{CP}{PE} \\cdot \\frac{EA}{AB} \\cdot \\frac{BD}{DC} = 1\\]\" width=\"156\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b97c62e7958d13ffc46031aea89d983d274dd67.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{CP}{PE} \\cdot \\frac{3}{5} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} = 1\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/c/23caad161cd602d968d2a98a189e33469875f121.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{CP}{PE} = 5\\]\" width=\"63\" height=\"37\" />\n-pengu14\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Ceva_and_Menelaus.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Ceva_and_Menelaus)\">Solution 4 (Ceva and Menelaus)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Ceva and Menelaus)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Draw <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f874b39870586f0504f50a667f2bafedddf47904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> to intersect line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/5/e657259c0995d2c36d46744bb4aa81471e6575ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. Then, through Ceva's on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/4/0c491e72c9f088719e84e84d0505a75e560dfb58.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{CX}{XA} \\cdot \\frac{AE}{EB} \\cdot \\frac{BD}{DC} = 1\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0fe381b18d6bc2728c72a121708f9426966f024.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{CX}{XA} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} = 1\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/6/896e043c00c4c9374b228c052ae03facb24fb83f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{CX}{XA} = 2\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Then, through Menelaus' on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/e/9fe8455276bddfed734a1bc5315bcd085fa3c012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CAE$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/1/911d5f2d212af11d23801b6eac2f41be848c0400.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{CX}{XA} \\cdot \\frac{AB}{BE} \\cdot \\frac{EP}{PC} = 1\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4fc9f6f5e9f72ff792cfd4a1c2603d78a967f8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 \\cdot \\frac{5}{2} \\cdot \\frac{EP}{PC} = 1\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/9/1b97e6254c9141e9553466f550b20c42d2cc80d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{EP}{PC} = \\frac{1}{5}\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/e/cce493ac4297fd36b3f168a4cb7fb531e64e4381.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PC}{EP} = \\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160